WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.360
When my mum calls twice, I always wonder
what I missed.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.320
Her question is simple: where are my
glasses?

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.520
But I can’t see the kitchen from here.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:09.640
I’m Daniel.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.580
This is Evelyn’s story.
